-   ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on dupindexcols
-         Recheck Cond: ((f1 >= 'WA'::text) AND (f1 <= 'ZZZ'::text) AND (id < 1000) AND (f1 ~<~ 'YX'::text))
-         ->  Bitmap Index Scan on dupindexcols_i
-               Index Cond: ((f1 >= 'WA'::text) AND (f1 <= 'ZZZ'::text) AND (id < 1000) AND (f1 ~<~ 'YX'::text))
-(5 rows)
