- inht4    | b       |           2 |        2
- inht4    | x       |           1 |        2
- inht4    | y       |           1 |        2
- inhts    | aaaa    |           1 |        1
- inhts    | b       |           2 |        1
- inhts    | x       |           1 |        1
- inhts    | c       |           1 |        1
