-   Output: $0
-   InitPlan 1 (returns $0)
-     ->  Limit
-           Output: ((1 - matest0.id))
-           ->  Result
-                 Output: ((1 - matest0.id))
-                 ->  Merge Append
-                       Sort Key: ((1 - matest0.id))
-                       ->  Index Scan using matest0i on public.matest0
