-----------------------------------------------------
- Hash Join
-   Hash Cond: (p2.a = p1.a)
-   ->  Seq Scan on permtest_grandchild p2
-   ->  Hash
-         ->  Seq Scan on permtest_grandchild p1
-               Filter: ("left"(c, 3) ~ 'a1$'::text)
-(6 rows)
