-                          View "public.rw_view1"
- Column |  Type   | Collation | Nullable | Default | Storage | Description 
---------+---------+-----------+----------+---------+---------+-------------
- a      | integer |           |          |         | plain   | 
- b      | integer |           |          |         | plain   | 
-View definition:
- SELECT base_tbl.a,
-    base_tbl.b
