-         Output: (1), i1.q1, sum(i1.q2)
-         Group Key: 1
-         Sort Key: i1.q1
-           Group Key: i1.q1
-         ->  Seq Scan on public.int8_tbl i1
-               Output: 1, i1.q1, i1.q2
-(10 rows)
-
