-----------+------------------
- 1        |                1
- 123bytes |              123
- 1kB      |             1024
- 1MB      |          1048576
-  1 GB    |       1073741824
- 1.5 GB   |       1610612736
- 1TB      |    1099511627776
- 3000 TB  | 3298534883328000
- 1e6 MB   |    1048576000000
