-         ->  Hash Join
-               Hash Cond: (((t2_2.b + t2_2.a) / 2) = ((t1_2.a + t1_2.b) / 2))
-               ->  Seq Scan on prt2_e_p3 t2_2
-               ->  Hash
-                     ->  Seq Scan on prt1_e_p3 t1_2
-                           Filter: (c = 0)
