-   ->  Seq Scan on boolrangep_ff2
-         Filter: ((a IS NOT TRUE) AND (NOT b) AND (c = 25))
-   ->  Seq Scan on boolrangep_ft
-         Filter: ((a IS NOT TRUE) AND (NOT b) AND (c = 25))
-   ->  Seq Scan on boolrangep_null
-         Filter: ((a IS NOT TRUE) AND (NOT b) AND (c = 25))
-(9 rows)
