----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Seq Scan on coll_pruning_multi2
-   Filter: ((substr(a, 1) = 'e'::text COLLATE "C") AND (substr(a, 1) = 'a'::text COLLATE "POSIX"))
-(2 rows)
