-    
-(1 row)
-
-execute ab_q4 (1, 8);
- avg 
------
-    
-(1 row)
-
-execute ab_q4 (1, 8);
- avg 
------
-    
-(1 row)
-
-execute ab_q4 (1, 8);
- avg 
------
-    
-(1 row)
-
-execute ab_q4 (1, 8);
- avg 
