-   ->  Index Scan using ma_test_p2_b_idx on ma_test_p2 (actual rows=10 loops=1)
-         Filter: (a >= $1)
-   ->  Index Scan using ma_test_p3_b_idx on ma_test_p3 (actual rows=10 loops=1)
-         Filter: (a >= $1)
-(14 rows)
